%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_1B21&DEV_2423&CC_0604
; The emulator's tunnel ports (usb4-emu; runs/run-39.md 39-0.7): the i440FX
; usb4-tunnel-bridge and the q35 usb4-tunnel-port.
%BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_1B36&DEV_0001&CC_0604
%BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_1B36&DEV_000C&CC_0604

